## Inspiration
- **Unsplash** — for the reference aesthetic (dark sphere with copper wire frame)
- **Glassmorphism design community** — for the frosted glass UI patterns
- **Bento grid layout** — popularized by Apple, Linear, Vercel

## Standards & Data Sources
- **NFPA 70 (NEC 2023)** — National Electrical Code
- **ASHRAE 90.1** — Energy Standard for Buildings
- **NFPA 70E** — Electrical Safety in the Workplace
- **IEC 60364** — Low-voltage electrical installations
- **IEC 62305** — Protection against lightning
- **IEEE 1584** — Arc flash hazard calculations

